WEBVTT

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:03.440
Finally, eight cards.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.020
We still have a long way to go.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:11.490
We've got to get to the King.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.870
I'm begging you, Master!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.080
Declined.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.330
At least hear me out.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:24.040
Declined.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.170
What's all the commotion at this hour?

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.420
Oh.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.510
Good morning, Sakura.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:35.260
I was just pleading with Master
for some intensive training.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:35.970
Intensive training?

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:40.310
During that battle the other day,
Master was so unbelievably powerful.

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:43.270
You've lived up to all of my expectations.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:47.610
So please, put this incompetent disciple
through intensive training.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:48.560
Declined.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.480
Would you do it for this?

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.400
Or this?

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.570
But this is...

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.620
Effective, I see.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.080
Fine then. Just this once.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:08.130
All right! Yay! Woo-hoo!

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:12.050
So croissants are your weakness.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:46.520
#04 Flower and Storm

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.350
Read 'em.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.730
Read 'em.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.980
Read 'em!

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:57.400
Man, I'm bored. I'm sick of all these.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:02:59.360
Ishinome?

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:00.490
Huh?

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:04.410
You better get your sleep,
or Higumacchi will be worried.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:08.000
I'm fine. Anyway, I need a favor.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.290
I want to see Teruto.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.710
Take me to him. I know you can do it.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.460
Easier said than done.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:20.050
If we get caught,
Higumacchi's going to give me hell.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.720
Are you going to take me, or not?

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.270
Will it be entertaining?

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:31.890
Of course.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:39.280
Anyone with weak cards, back of the line!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:42.070
The strong players get first dibs. Move!

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:44.110
Let's go.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.160
Right.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.950
You upperclassmen there. Battle us!

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:50.410
Huh?

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.620
The bread from this shop. All in.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.800
What do the two of you think you're doing?

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:00.210
Intensive training.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.590
Do you want some, Sakura?

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.930
I'm good, thanks.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:07.890
What part of this is intensive training?

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.020
All you did was fight over fresh baked bread.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.940
Additional information on "fresh baked bread."

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:15.270
NEW INFORMATION

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.270
Special edition croissants?

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.570
Hey, what are those?

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:18.520
This is our next tar—

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.530
Oh no you don't.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:23.200
You call it intensive training,
but you're just making Hiyori navigate.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:24.950
Navigate, did you say?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:32.910
Sakura, to be like Master, you must gaze
upon the same scenery, and eat the same food.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:36.920
Therefore, I'm ready to navigate,
skip rope, or anything at all.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.750
Let's go, Master.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.300
Special edition croissants are waiting for you.

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:43.130
Right.

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:50.140
Fine. I'll go search for challengers.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.110
Let's continue the operation.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.280
What's this?

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:08.030
I don't see the shop anywhere.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.280
You think it's over there?

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:12.450
I'm going to take a look, okay?

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.500
Excuse me, Mister.

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.500
Are you any good at this?

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.920
If you can beat me...

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:27.090
I'll give you this.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:33.720
Those are...

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.400
You fell for it.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.700
Master! What is this place?

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:49.870
You shouldn't have come.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:54.500
Huh? Oh my gosh! Ouch.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:55.870
Hiyoko?

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:00.210
Am I supposed to beg you for something?

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:02.590
That's not it. Who is that girl?

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.710
She doesn’t seem to be a challenger.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:08.840
Don't worry.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.930
I'll let her go as soon as we're done.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.230
Whoever that top points to when it falls goes first.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:25.860
Call. Bloom.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.950
Call. Margreia.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.500
All right. Ready?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:45.710
Yeah.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.170
- Build-Divide.
- Build-Divide.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:50.510
You can do it, Master!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.140
All right, then.

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:54.720
Show us a good time.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:59.020
Don't worry, I'll keep that kid in check.

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:10.400
There, a challenger.

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:13.870
For a bad child like you,
I'll punish you with an electric shock.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:17.910
Using Grona, Thunder Spirit to attack Nadiya.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:20.920
My turn.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.120
Accept.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.080
Ambition Eater.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.460
Wow, decoy!

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:29.800
Now his defenses will be rock solid
even if he gets attacked next turn.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:32.130
Keep it coming, Master!

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:37.180
First things first. I'm going to count your sins.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:45.310
Grona's Judgment ability.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:47.360
Every time my opponent sends out a unit...

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:50.320
I acquire one Conviction Counter.

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:53.030
Conviction Counter?

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:56.830
It's what I need to bring down the gavel of justice.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:08:01.250
My deck is distinctive for using this counter to battle.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.040
Are you kidding me?

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.750
But, Master is fighting right back.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.500
Go, go, Master!

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.590
Using Ambition Eater to attack the player.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:13.720
End of turn.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:14.800
My turn.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:16.930
This battle has only just begun.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:19.890
Even though she's tipped her hand once...

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:23.560
There's no telling what she'll bring out next.

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:26.360
Better beware of such dangerous tactics.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:27.860
My turn.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:30.320
Are you going to release your Territory now?

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:33.950
I can't wait to see your Territory.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:39.080
Show me, Teruto. Hurry up.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:41.830
<i>What was that just now?</i>

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.960
<i>I won't let you down.</i>

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:53.720
Sending all living beings into chaos.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:57.640
Repeating death and rebirth.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.970
Wow! Here it comes.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:04.520
Accept. Bloom, Soul Wager.

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.690
Territory. Build Arise.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.320
Casino of Fate!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.830
Those eyes. It's been such a long time.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:26.080
Activating Casino of Fate's ability.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.710
Any Buster Cards?

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.550
Just one?

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:34.010
That didn't work out.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.640
But, he's got three more in the Cemetery.

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:39.510
You're still in this, Master!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.720
But first things first.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:47.520
Guilty.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:49.650
That again?

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:52.020
Using Bloom to attack Grona.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.360
End of turn.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.410
Now it's eight versus eight lives.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:05.160
I have no idea what that thing is,
but this battle isn't over by a long shot.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.080
Give it all you've got, Master!

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.260
<i>This feels strange.</i>

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:24.270
<i>It's like I'm being teased into pursuing him.</i>

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.190
<i>Where are those two now?</i>

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:32.270
What?

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.730
Location unknown?

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:37.860
Maybe I'll start taking this seriously.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.700
My turn.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:42.370
I'm going to release my Territory.

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.830
Putting everything in the universe on a scale.

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:49.330
Thou who brings judgment upon others.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:50.790
Accept.

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:55.340
Margreia, Angel of Justice.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.720
Territory. Build Arise.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.730
Shrine of Justice.

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:14.770
Oh, what a beautiful angel.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.990
This is my Territory and Ace, Margreia.

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:23.490
I'm going to put good and evil on this scale,
and bring you to justice for your sins.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:25.700
Activating Territory ability.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:31.370
Forcing out one unit into my hand.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.460
Go back, Bloom.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.220
It's like he drew Bloom for nothing.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:46.260
Since I consumed the Conviction Counter,
Margreia gains five thousand power and one hit.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.260
What?

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:51.600
Using Margreia with her increased
power and hit to attack the player.

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:00.610
Shot Trigger!

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.320
Command. Sorcerer's Scheme.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:06.080
Decreasing Nadiya's power by six thousand.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:12.920
Oh dear, you destroyed her.
The luck of the draw is always with you.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.170
<i>Again?</i>

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:18.710
My turn.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.670
Activating Casino of Fate's ability.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.050
Buster Cards...

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:24.510
Zero!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.300
Destroying Margreia.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.270
Activating Shrine of Justice's ability.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.020
Guilty.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:32.390
Accept.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.100
Rizome, Black Knight.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:38.020
Using Rizome to attack the player.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:41.570
My turn.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:45.740
Let me introduce you to my other favorite angel.

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:47.200
Accept.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:50.080
Elizabelt, Angel of Law.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:54.750
Activating her ability.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.710
Consuming one Conviction Counter,
and drawing one card.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.840
Cost. Accepting units under five.

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:02.670
Margreia.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:10.810
Since I consumed the Conviction Counter,
Margreia gains five thousand power and one hit.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.270
Not again?

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.480
Using Margreia to attack Rizome.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:16.770
Quick Timing. Hard Luck Craps.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.860
Decreasing Margreia's power by three thousand.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.150
That's my Master.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:23.530
You shot down one unit.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.240
I still have another.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.530
Using Elizabelt to attack Rizome.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:33.660
Oh, he lost another one.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.170
This girl is good.

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:42.880
This is so much fun.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:48.260
You're the only person in the world
who can keep me this entertained, Teruto.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.550
<i>How did she know my name?</i>

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.890
Did you forget about me?

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:59.940
After we played together all those times,
time and time again?

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:09.490
<i>It's not enough.
Play with me more, Teruto. With me.</i>

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:13.870
<i>Teruto.</i>

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.080
<i>Teruto.</i>

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.880
<i>Play with me, Teruto.</i>

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:30.180
Are you...

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:34.100
<i>I can't reach either of them.</i>

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:37.310
<i>Disruption like this can only be Ishinome.</i>

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.820
<i>Here. That one is nearby.</i>

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:45.820
<i>But why?</i>

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:58.960
Master, what's the matter? Master!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.000
<i>I know this person.</i>

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:09.720
<i>I know these fangs that she bared
to drive me into a corner.</i>

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.390
Yay, Shot Trigger!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.970
Command. Shackle of Ethics.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:18.430
Go back, Bloom.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:21.520
To the deck this time?

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.020
My turn.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:27.230
You still love croissants, am I right?

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:33.320
You shouldn't accept candy from strangers
and then follow them around.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:36.950
Well, it is the reason we're playing together again.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:42.040
But even if you did make it back,
you're not as good as you were before.

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.790
What did you come back for?

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.960
Without considering how I might feel.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:51.050
Master, do you know this person?

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:54.970
Hey, what's the deal anyway?
Calling him Master like this and that.

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:58.850
No one can be friends with Teruto but me.

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:01.890
No one can be visible to him but me.

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.610
No one can play with Teruto but me.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:10.110
Forever, and ever, no one but me!

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:12.530
No one but me!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:15.740
No way, four lives at once?

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:20.410
All right, Teruto. Look at me.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.670
Don't look at anyone but me.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:27.380
Great. I'm getting goosebumps.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.510
Show me more, both of you.

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:32.050
Getting cornered,
then cornering the other right back.

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:36.550
Show me a battle so spine-tingling,
it will destroy the whole world.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:38.100
My turn.

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Bloom. Will you still lend me a helping hand?</i>

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:49.280
<i>There's still a way out of this.
Never have I...</i>

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:52.990
<i>I've never even thought about losing.</i>

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.570
I'm going to follow my own path!

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.700
Accept. Bloom!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.460
Activating Bloom's ability.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.330
Come back to life.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.630
Riverwort, DeadRook!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:10.550
Activating ability.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.630
Decreasing the power of all
opposing units by six thousand.

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:17.390
Using Nadiya to attack Elizabelt.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.810
He did it, he took down Elizabelt.

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.730
Now he just has to make it through the next turn.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:25.230
Master hasn't given up.

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.190
He believes in his own path.

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:29.110
My turn.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:32.440
You were always like this, Teruto.

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.910
No matter how far I drove you into a corner,
you always looked at me with those eyes.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.870
That's why I love this moment the best.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.750
Refusing to give up no matter
how close you are to the edge.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:47.040
That look in your eyes that
you fix on me until the end.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:53.010
I wonder how I'm going to destroy them,
and I can't stop trembling in this moment.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.590
There's no point playing someone weak.

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:58.970
No point unless it's you, the strongest of them all.

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.430
I want to destroy you because it's you.

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:04.430
Over and over.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:12.020
Destroying you Teruto, the most powerful,
with my own two hands is my greatest joy.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:14.990
No way.

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.740
Margreia again?

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:20.950
Now it's time to say goodbye, Teruto.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:25.290
Using Margreia for my Two-Hit Attack.

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.330
Shot Trigger!

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.960
Command. Cursed Trump Card.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.470
Destroying Margreia.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:42.930
Quick Timing. Collapse of Rationality.

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:45.140
Eliminating the Cursed Trump Card.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.100
No way.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:55.530
Teruto.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.320
Teruto.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:03.530
I love you.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:07.710
Huh? That person...

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.250
Ouch.

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:18.840
Where are we?

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:21.050
Master!

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.430
Are you okay, Master?

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:31.900
I had so much fun. Thanks, Teruto.

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:37.030
Master, I never would have guessed
that you knew this person.

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:37.690
What?

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.700
This person is the one you've been trying to reach.

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:43.570
Kikka, the King. Didn't you know?

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:51.670
That's right. I am the King.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.290
You didn't know?

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:56.250
No way...

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:01.720
Hey. Stay with me, Master!

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:07.100
Teruto. Hiyori.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.890
Sakura!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.020
What's wrong with Teruto?

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:13.730
Oops, no good. Better head back.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:17.980
Hey, wait. We're not done talking.

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:31.160
Ishinome. What's he doing here?

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.960
Teruto, did you fight, by any chance?

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:37.090
He sure did. With the King, Kikka.

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.170
Don't tell me she...

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:44.680
Kikka is...

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:47.260
My little sister.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:50.560
Little sister?

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:55.560
No way.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:15.540
Where have you been?

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:21.510
Nowhere. I've been here.

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:24.720
I don't remember giving you permission to go out.

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:27.600
Come on. I'm the King right?

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:39.060
You can have this.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:40.110
What?

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:41.860
I don't need it anymore.

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:51.620
That was so fun. I wish we could play again.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:54.160
Right, Teruto?

00:21:57.000 --> 00:22:00.000
TO BE CONTINUED

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:34.470
Is he going to give up on challenging the King?

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:37.180
Hiyori, can you come with me?

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:40.020
#05 Cake and Fishhook

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:39.230
Why do you battle?
